WEBVTT

00:01.686 --> 00:04.656
[dramatic orchestral music]
[戏剧管弦乐]

00:04.689 --> 00:10.895
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:10.995 --> 00:14.666
- JUST A COUPLE MORE ADDITIVES,
SPONGEBOB.
- 只是更多的添加剂，
海绵宝宝。

00:14.699 --> 00:16.000
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

00:16.100 --> 00:17.101
[cracking]
[开裂]

00:17.201 --> 00:18.335
[pop]
[流行音乐]

00:18.435 --> 00:20.672
OH, AND TRY NOT
TO BREATHE THE FUMES.
哦，不要尝试
呼吸烟雾。

00:20.738 --> 00:23.174
- IS IT TOXIC PATTY TUESDAY?
- 周二的肉饼有毒吗？

00:23.274 --> 00:25.342
- BARNACLES, NO, BOYO.
- 藤壶，不，男孩。

00:25.442 --> 00:28.179
THE CUSTOMERS KEEP PASSING OFF
THEIR DIRTY, FILTHY MONEY,
顾客不断冒充
他们的肮脏的钱，

00:28.279 --> 00:30.347
SO WE'RE COOKING UP THE ONLY
SOLUTION POWERFUL ENOUGH
所以我们正在烹饪唯一的
解决方案足够强大

00:30.447 --> 00:31.448
TO CLEAN IT.
清洁它。

00:31.548 --> 00:33.150
- WELL, THEN,
LET'S GET CLEANING.
- 那么，
让我们开始清洁吧。

00:33.250 --> 00:34.518
- HOLD ON, KIDDO.
- 坚持住，孩子。

00:34.686 --> 00:37.188
WE STILL HAVE
ONE MORE INGREDIENT.
我们还有
另一种成分。

00:37.288 --> 00:39.691
- HOW MUCH DO WE NEED?
- CAREFUL, SPONGEBOB!
- 我们需要多少？
- 小心，海绵宝宝！

00:39.757 --> 00:41.458
JUST TWO DROPS
OF THAT STUFF COULD...
只需两滴
那东西可以...

00:41.558 --> 00:43.127
- GOT IT.
TWO DROPS--
- 知道了。
两滴——

00:45.930 --> 00:48.032
- BLOW OUR FACES OFF.
- 打爆我们的脸。

00:48.132 --> 00:49.566
[fax machine ringing]
[传真机响铃]

00:49.701 --> 00:50.768
- FAX COMING THROUGH, BOSS.
- 传真过来了，老板。

00:50.868 --> 00:52.536
- WE CAN GET IT LATER.
- 我们可以稍后再获取。

00:52.704 --> 00:55.439
[fax machine trilling,
clacking]
[传真机颤音，
咔哒声]

00:55.539 --> 00:56.941
[pop]
- [laughs]
[流行音乐]
- [笑]

00:57.041 --> 00:59.711
INFILTRATION ACHIEVED.
渗透成功。

00:59.744 --> 01:03.715
PHASE ONE, COMPLETE.
第一阶段，完成。

01:03.815 --> 01:07.551
NOW FOR PHASE TWO.
现在进入第二阶段。

01:11.923 --> 01:12.890
SABOTAGE!
破坏！

01:12.990 --> 01:15.927
- [cheerful whistling]
- [欢快的口哨声]

01:16.027 --> 01:17.428
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

01:17.528 --> 01:19.964
WELL, MY DEPENDABLE SPATULA,
SHALL WE?
好吧，我可靠的抹刀，
我们可以吗？

01:20.064 --> 01:22.466
[hornpipe music]
[喇叭音乐]

01:22.566 --> 01:23.467
[snap]
[折断]

01:23.567 --> 01:24.535
[clank]
[铮铮]

01:24.635 --> 01:26.270
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

01:26.370 --> 01:29.540
- WOW! PHASE TWO IS GREAT!
- 哇！第二阶段很棒！

01:29.640 --> 01:31.208
MY FAVORITE PHASE SO FAR.
到目前为止我最喜欢的阶段。

01:31.308 --> 01:32.877
[evil laugh]
[邪恶的笑声]

01:32.977 --> 01:35.312
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

01:35.412 --> 01:36.881
NO PULSE!
没有脉搏！

01:36.981 --> 01:39.016
[clinking]
[叮叮当当]

01:39.116 --> 01:40.351
WE'RE LOSING HIM!
我们要失去他了！

01:40.451 --> 01:41.385
HANG IN THERE, BUDDY!
坚持住，伙计！

01:41.485 --> 01:43.220
- WHAT'S ALL THE RUCKUS?
- CLEAR!
- 到底发生了什么骚动？
- 清除！

01:43.320 --> 01:45.522
[sizzling]
CLEAR!
[嘶嘶声]
清楚！

01:45.622 --> 01:47.324
- PULL YOURSELF TOGETHER, BOY.
- 振作起来，男孩。

01:47.424 --> 01:49.660
SO YOUR SPATULA SNAPPED.
所以你的抹刀折断了。

01:49.761 --> 01:50.795
GO GET YOURSELF A NEW ONE!
去给自己买一件新的吧！

01:50.895 --> 01:53.397
- I'LL NEVER FORGET YOU.
- 我永远不会忘记你。

01:53.497 --> 01:54.498
- [slaps]
QUIT THAT, BOY.
- [巴掌]
别这样，男孩。

01:54.598 --> 01:55.566
IT'S CREEPY.
太令人毛骨悚然了。

01:55.666 --> 01:57.601
"SPAT-U-LERS" CAN'T TALK.
“吐口水者”不会说话。

01:57.769 --> 01:59.603
AND IF I CATCH YOUSE TALKING
TO YOUR NEXT ONE,
如果我发现你在说话
对于你的下一个，

01:59.771 --> 02:02.106
I'LL LOCK YOU UP
IN A PADDED KITCHEN.
我会把你锁起来
在带衬垫的厨房里。

02:05.777 --> 02:06.778
- [laughs]
- [笑]

02:06.844 --> 02:08.479
JUST LIKE CLOCKWORK.
就像发条一样。

02:08.579 --> 02:10.414
- [cheerful whistling]
- THE TWERP APPROACHES.
- [欢快的口哨声]
- 特沃普方法。

02:10.514 --> 02:13.384
TIME FOR PHASE THREE.
第三阶段的时间到了。

02:17.421 --> 02:18.322
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

02:18.422 --> 02:20.792
[clank]
[whoosh]
[叮当声]
[嗖嗖]

02:20.825 --> 02:22.794
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

02:22.827 --> 02:24.061
- OH, HI, PLANKTON!
- 哦，嗨，浮游生物！

02:24.161 --> 02:26.530
WHAT BRINGS YOU
TO HARVEY'S SPATULA EMPORIUM?
是什么给你带来了
去哈维抹刀商场？

02:26.630 --> 02:28.565
- OH, JUST PICKING UP
ONE OF THESE.
- 哦，刚刚接电话
其中之一。

02:28.665 --> 02:31.335
NOT THAT YOU'D KNOW WHAT IT IS.
并不是说你知道它是什么。

02:31.435 --> 02:32.669
- WELL, JUDGING
FROM ITS DIAMETER
- 好吧，判断
从它的直径来看

02:32.804 --> 02:33.971
AND VERMILLION COLOR,
和朱红色，

02:34.071 --> 02:35.639
I AM LOOKING AT THE HANDLE CAP
我正在看手柄盖

02:35.807 --> 02:38.675
FOR A VINTAGE
GRILL FORCE 700 SPATULA.
复古款
GRILL FORCE 700 抹刀。

02:38.810 --> 02:42.113
- WOW! A FELLOW
SPATULA ENTHUSIAST, I SEE.
- 哇！一个研究员
抹刀爱好者，我明白了。

02:42.213 --> 02:43.380
YOU'RE RIGHT, SPONGEBOB.
你是对的，海绵宝宝。

02:43.480 --> 02:45.316
BUT WITH A FEW MODIFICATIONS,
但经过一些修改，

02:45.416 --> 02:48.552
IT'LL SERVE AS THE ENDCAP
FOR MY SIZZLEMASTER.
它将作为端盖
为了我的嘶嘶声大师。

02:48.652 --> 02:50.254
- WELL, I'VE NEVER EVEN HEARD
OF THAT MODEL.
- 嗯，我从来没有听说过
该型号的。

02:50.354 --> 02:52.323
- WELL, THERE IS ONLY ONE.
- 嗯，只有一个。

02:52.423 --> 02:55.960
AND SOME SAY
IT HAS MAGICAL GRILLING POWERS.
有人说
它具有神奇的烧烤能力。

02:56.060 --> 02:58.830
- WOW! I MUST KNOW MORE.
- 哇！我必须了解更多。

02:58.896 --> 03:01.132
- WELL, YOU COULD COME OVER
AND CHECK IT OUT.
- 好吧，你可以过来
并检查一下。

03:01.232 --> 03:02.499
- THAT SOUNDS THRILLING!
- 听起来很激动人心！

03:02.599 --> 03:03.935
BUT I DO NEED
TO HURRY BACK TO WORK.
但我确实需要
赶紧回去工作。

03:04.035 --> 03:05.636
- [knocking]
SPONGEBOB,
- [敲门声]
海绵宝宝，

03:05.736 --> 03:08.840
IT'S A MAGICAL SPATULA
WITH A LEGEND.
这是一把神奇的抹刀
具有传奇色彩。

03:08.906 --> 03:11.708
THIS IS
A ONCE-IN-A-LIFETIME EXPERIENCE.
这是
一生一次的体验。

03:11.843 --> 03:14.511
ONWARD TO THE CHUM BUCKET!
前往密友桶！

03:14.611 --> 03:16.380
[evil laugh]
[邪恶的笑声]

03:16.480 --> 03:19.716
HEY, IT'S THIS WAY, KID.
嘿，就是这样，孩子。

03:19.851 --> 03:23.120
FEAST YOUR ABSORBENT EYES
ON THIS!
尽情享受您的双眼
关于这个！

03:23.220 --> 03:24.355
[claps]
[鼓掌]

03:24.455 --> 03:26.523
- [gasps]
WOW!
- [喘气]
哇！

03:26.623 --> 03:28.559
THIS IS
THE GREATEST SPATULA COLLECTION
这是
最伟大的抹刀系列

03:28.659 --> 03:30.161
ON THE WHOLE SEAFLOOR.
在整个海底。

03:30.261 --> 03:32.997
- THESE ARE NOTHING
COMPARED TO...
- 这些都不算什么
相比...

03:33.097 --> 03:34.331
[claps]
[鼓掌]

03:34.431 --> 03:37.068
THE MAJESTIC SIZZLEMASTER!
雄伟的嘶嘶声大师！

03:37.168 --> 03:40.471
[heavenly harp music]
- * AHH
【天箜篌音乐】
- * 啊哈

03:40.571 --> 03:42.006
- YES, SPONGEBOB.
- 是的，海绵宝宝。

03:42.106 --> 03:45.509
I BELIEVE THE SIZZLEMASTER
HAS FOUND ITS FRY COOK
我相信嘶嘶声大师
找到了它的炒菜厨师

03:45.609 --> 03:47.244
IN YOU!
[glass shatters]
在你里面！
[玻璃碎裂]

03:47.344 --> 03:49.246
- THE LEGEND
OF THE SIZZLEMASTER
- 传奇
嘶嘶大师的

03:49.346 --> 03:50.614
HAS BEEN FULFILLED!
已经实现了！

03:50.714 --> 03:52.884
AND SINCE YOU ARE ITS FRY COOK,
既然你是它的炒菜厨师，

03:52.984 --> 03:56.487
IT WILL REDUCE
YOUR WORKLOAD TENFOLD.
它会减少
您的工作量增加十倍。

03:56.587 --> 03:58.322
- HEY, THAT RHYMES!
- 嘿，这押韵！

03:58.422 --> 04:00.457
ALMOST.
几乎。

04:00.557 --> 04:02.793
- YES, A LEGEND
HAS BEEN FULFILLED TODAY.
- 是的，一个传奇
今天已经实现了。

04:02.894 --> 04:04.896
GO FORTH, SPONGEBOB.
出发吧，海绵宝宝。

04:04.962 --> 04:06.630
WOULDN'T WANT YOU
TO MISS THE LUNCH RUSH.
不想要你
错过午餐高峰。

04:06.730 --> 04:08.332
[softly]
OR, AS I LIKE TO CALL IT,
[轻声]
或者，正如我喜欢这样称呼它，

04:08.432 --> 04:09.800
PHASE FOUR.
第四阶段。

04:09.901 --> 04:11.435
- PHASE FOUR?
- 第四阶段？

04:11.535 --> 04:14.471
HOW MANY PHASES ARE THERE
IN THIS CONVOLUTED PLAN?
有多少相
在这个复杂的计划中？

04:14.571 --> 04:16.473
- ENOUGH, MY SARCASTIC WIFE.
- 够了，我讽刺的妻子。

04:16.573 --> 04:19.310
ENOUGH
TO GAIN SPONGEBOB'S TRUST,
够了
为了获得海绵宝宝的信任，

04:19.410 --> 04:21.312
THEN STEAL
THE KRABBY PATTY FORMULA
然后偷
蟹黄饼配方

04:21.412 --> 04:23.014
RIGHT FROM UNDER
HIS DUMB YELLOW NOSE!
自下而上
他那愚蠢的黄鼻子！

04:23.114 --> 04:24.248
[laughs]
[笑]

04:24.348 --> 04:27.484
NOW TO TUNE IN SPONGE-BOOB.
现在收听海绵布。

04:27.584 --> 04:29.520
[electrical whir]
- I'M BACK, MR. KRABS.
[电呼呼声]
- 我回来了，先生。螃蟹。

04:29.620 --> 04:30.687
DID I MISS ANYTHING?
我错过了什么吗？

04:30.787 --> 04:32.023
- YOU'RE GONNA BE MISSING A JOB
- 你会失业的

04:32.123 --> 04:33.124
IF YOU DON'T GET
IN THAT KITCHEN.
如果你没有得到
在那个厨房里。

04:33.224 --> 04:35.626
THE LUNCH RUSH IS NIGH!
午餐高峰即将来临！

04:35.726 --> 04:37.661
- [evil laugh]
- [邪恶的笑声]

04:37.761 --> 04:39.463
- THESE ORDERS HAVE
REALLY PILED UP.
- 这些订单有
真的堆积如山。

04:39.563 --> 04:44.168
- AND DON'T FORGET THESE.
- 不要忘记这些。

04:44.268 --> 04:47.104
- WELL, NOTHING ME AND
THE SIZZLEMASTER CAN'T HANDLE.
- 好吧，没有我和
SIZZLMaster 无法处理。

04:47.204 --> 04:48.772
- THAT'S RIGHT SPONGEBOB!
- 这就是海绵宝宝！

04:48.940 --> 04:51.342
LET'S SHOW THIS LUNCH RUSH
WHAT FOR!
让我们来看看午餐高峰期
做什么用！

04:51.442 --> 04:52.676
- HMM, I MUST BE HEARING THINGS.
- 嗯，我一定是听到了什么声音。

04:52.776 --> 04:55.046
'CAUSE MR. KRABS SAYS
SPATULAS CAN'T TALK.
因为先生。蟹蟹说
抹刀不会说话。

04:55.146 --> 04:56.147
- WELL, I CAN!
- 嗯，我可以！

04:56.247 --> 04:58.983
THE MYSTICAL SIZZLEMASTER
CAN DO ALL!
神秘的嘶嘶声大师
无所不能！

04:59.083 --> 05:01.585
- MR. KRABS SAID HE'D PUT ME
IN A PADDED KITCHEN
- 先生。蟹蟹说他放了我
在带衬垫的厨房里

05:01.685 --> 05:02.954
IF HE CAUGHT ME TALKING TO YOU.
如果他发现我在跟你说话。

05:03.054 --> 05:05.289
- SPONGEBOB!
- I WASN'T TAKING TO MY SPATULA!
- 海绵宝宝！
- 我没有用我的抹刀！

05:05.389 --> 05:06.857
- I DON'T CARE IF YOU WERE.
- 我不在乎你是否在。

05:06.958 --> 05:08.659
THE CUSTOMERS ARE ABOUT TO SNAP!
顾客们快要疯了！

05:08.759 --> 05:10.194
[cranking, snap]
[摇动，啪嗒]

05:10.294 --> 05:11.963
- TIME TO FOCUS.
- 是时候集中精力了。

05:12.063 --> 05:13.597
- YOU KNOW, SPONGEBOB,
- 你知道，海绵宝宝，

05:13.697 --> 05:16.033
THERE'S A MUCH FASTER WAY
TO DO THIS.
有更快的方法
这样做。

05:16.133 --> 05:19.971
- OH?
- 哦？

05:20.004 --> 05:21.405
- WOW! PRETTY GOOD.
- 哇！不错。

05:21.505 --> 05:25.176
BUT WE'RE A LONG, LONG WAY
FROM FILLING ALL THESE ORDERS.
但我们还有很长很长的路要走
从填写所有这些订单开始。

05:26.643 --> 05:28.479
- [whooshing]
- [呼啸]

05:28.579 --> 05:30.547
- HEY, SPONGE.
- 嘿，海绵。

05:30.647 --> 05:33.784
I KNOW A WAY
TO DOUBLE OUR PRODUCTIVITY.
我知道一个办法
让我们的生产力加倍。

05:33.884 --> 05:36.853
I'LL HANDLE THINGS HERE
AT THE GRILL, ALONE,
我来处理这里的事情
独自在烧烤店，

05:36.988 --> 05:39.890
WHILE YOU MAN
THE CONDIMENTS, HUH?
当你是男人时
调味品，嗯？

05:39.991 --> 05:41.592
- HEY! THAT'S A GREAT IDEA!
- 嘿！这是个好主意！

05:41.692 --> 05:44.261
BUT YOU MAN THE CONDIMENTS,
I'LL TAKE THE GRILL.
但你会用调味品，
我要烧烤架。

05:44.361 --> 05:47.131
SORRY, BUT I DON'T TRUST ANYONE
WITH THIS BABY, BUT ME.
抱歉，但我不相信任何人
和这个孩子，除了我。

05:47.231 --> 05:48.432
- DRAT!
- 哎呀！

05:48.532 --> 05:49.833
- HEY, SQUID GUY!
- 嘿，鱿鱼佬！

05:50.001 --> 05:51.635
WHERE'S MY LUNCH?
我的午餐在哪里？

05:51.735 --> 05:54.005
- STAY BACK,
YOU RAVENOUS BRUTES.
- 退后，
你们这些贪婪的畜生。

05:54.071 --> 05:56.473
OH!
- ORDERS, AHOY!
哦！
- 订单，啊哈！

05:56.573 --> 06:01.012
[cash register bell ringing]
[收银铃声响起]

06:01.045 --> 06:02.279
WOW, SIZZLEMASTER!
哇，嘶嘶声大师！

06:02.379 --> 06:03.514
YOU TRULY ARE MAGICAL.
你真的很神奇。

06:03.614 --> 06:04.648
WE'RE CATCHING UP.
我们正在迎头赶上。

06:04.748 --> 06:06.150
BUT WE GOT AN EMPTY GRILL HERE.
但我们这里有一个空烤架。

06:06.250 --> 06:09.720
- LEAVE IT TO ME, KID.
- 交给我吧，孩子。

06:13.424 --> 06:15.059
- ALL RIGHT,
GOOD NIGHT, BOYO.
- 好吧，
晚安，男孩。

06:15.159 --> 06:16.360
HEADING HOME.
回家。

06:16.460 --> 06:18.829
THANKS FOR ALL THE EXTRA
GREENBACKS YOU EARNED ME TODAY.
感谢所有额外的
今天你为我赚到了美元。

06:18.929 --> 06:20.331
- DON'T THANK ME, MR. KRABS.
- 别谢我，先生。螃蟹。

06:20.431 --> 06:23.167
THANK MY NEW MAGIC
TALKING SPATULA.
感谢我的新魔法
会说话的铲子。

06:23.267 --> 06:24.935
- OOH, THAT'S GREAT SPONGEBOB.
- 哦，那是很棒的海绵宝宝。

06:25.036 --> 06:26.903
WAIT A MINUTE.
等一下。

06:27.038 --> 06:29.740
WHAT DID I TELL YA ABOUT TALKING
TO "SPAT-U-LERS."
我告诉过你什么关于说话的事
致“吐口水者”。

06:29.840 --> 06:32.576
ONLY DO IT IF IT MAKES ME MONEY.
只有当它能让我赚钱时才去做。

06:32.676 --> 06:34.445
[chuckles]
[笑声]

06:34.545 --> 06:36.913
- WELL, YOU CAN REALLY DO
WONDERS, SIZZLEMASTER.
- 嗯，你真的可以做到
奇迹，嘶嘶声大师。

06:37.048 --> 06:38.382
TODAY WAS GREAT.
今天太棒了。

06:38.482 --> 06:40.584
- IT SURE WAS, SPONGEBOB.
- 确实如此，海绵宝宝。

06:40.684 --> 06:45.056
AND MAYBE TOMORROW I CAN EVEN
HANDLE THE GRILL FOR YOU, HUH?
也许明天我什至可以
为你处理烤架，嗯？

06:45.156 --> 06:46.857
- [laughs]
UNLIKELY.
- [笑]
不太可能。

06:46.957 --> 06:48.425
BUT A SPATULA CAN DREAM.
但抹刀可以梦想。

06:48.525 --> 06:50.461
SEE YOU TOMORROW.
- DANG IT!
明天见。
- 该死！

06:50.561 --> 06:53.430
I NEED SPONGEBOB
TO TRUST ME BEHIND THAT GRILL
我需要海绵宝宝
相信我在烧烤架后面

06:53.530 --> 06:55.366
FOR THIS PLAN TO WORK.
为了使这个计划发挥作用。

06:55.466 --> 06:57.368
HMM. OH!
唔。哦！

06:57.468 --> 06:58.869
HEY, SPONGEBOB!
- YES?
嘿，海绵宝宝！
- 是的？

06:58.969 --> 07:01.138
- HOW ABOUT YOU TAKE ME BACK
TO YOUR PLACE TONIGHT?
- 你带我回去怎么样
今晚去你那儿吗？

07:01.238 --> 07:03.740
I MEAN, I COULD HELP YOU
AROUND THE HOUSE.
我的意思是，我可以帮助你
房子周围。

07:03.840 --> 07:05.742
- WELL, I'M NOT GOING
TO BE GRILLING TONIGHT,
- 好吧，我不去
今晚要烧烤，

07:05.842 --> 07:06.910
BUT THANK YOU.
但谢谢你。

07:07.078 --> 07:09.946
- OH, I AM SO MUCH MORE
THAN A PATTY FLIPPER.
- 哦，我还有更多
比肉饼。

07:10.081 --> 07:11.848
I'M A MULTIPURPOSE TOOL.
我是一个多功能工具。

07:11.948 --> 07:14.751
- OH. HEY, DO YOU CLEAN
SNAIL LITTER BOXES?
- 哦。嘿，你打扫卫生吗
蜗牛垃圾箱？

07:14.851 --> 07:17.088
SURE!
- GROSS.
当然！
- 总的。

07:17.188 --> 07:19.556
- IT'S NOT LIKE IT'S
ACTUALLY ME TOUCHING IT, SO...
- 事情不是这样的
实际上是我在触摸它，所以...

07:19.656 --> 07:21.192
- HERE SHE IS.
- 她在这里。

07:21.292 --> 07:22.493
HOME SWEET PINEAPPLE.
家乡的甜菠萝。

07:22.593 --> 07:24.895
- INFILTRATION COMPLETE.
- 渗透完成。

07:24.995 --> 07:28.399
TIME TO EXECUTE PHASE FIVE!
是时候执行第五阶段了！

07:28.499 --> 07:29.400
[evil laugh]
[邪恶的笑声]

07:29.500 --> 07:30.867
- [laughs]
- [笑]

07:30.967 --> 07:33.504
YOU'RE SUCH A JOYFUL BEING,
SIZZLEMASTER.
你真是一个快乐的人，
嘶嘶声大师。

07:33.604 --> 07:35.706
HERE'S THAT LITTER BOX
YOU SAID YOU'D CLEAN.
这是那个垃圾箱
你说过你会打扫的。

07:35.806 --> 07:37.108
- [sniffs]
GAH!
- [嗅嗅]
嘎啊！

07:37.208 --> 07:38.375
KAREN!
凯伦！

07:38.475 --> 07:41.578
I THOUGHT I TOLD YOU NOT
TO PUT SMELL SENSORS
我以为我没有告诉过你
安装气味传感器

07:41.678 --> 07:43.147
ON THE SPATULA!
在抹刀上！

07:43.247 --> 07:45.382
[crickets chirping]
[蟋蟀鸣叫]

07:45.482 --> 07:47.818
[foghorn blares]
[雾号声]

07:47.918 --> 07:48.919
- WHOOP!
- 哎呀！

07:49.019 --> 07:52.256
[rollicking ukulele music]
[欢快的尤克里里音乐]

07:52.356 --> 07:54.558
[scratching]
[抓挠]

07:54.658 --> 07:55.626
[chime]
[铃声]

08:01.265 --> 08:03.834
- MMM, MMM.
- 嗯，嗯。

08:08.705 --> 08:11.007
WOW! I'M THREE HOURS EARLY
TO WORK.
哇！我早到了三个小时
去工作。

08:11.108 --> 08:12.609
THANKS TO YOU, SIZZLEMASTER.
谢谢你，Sizzlemaster。

08:12.709 --> 08:15.612
- THAT'S NO PROBLEM, BUDDY.
- 这没问题，伙计。

08:15.712 --> 08:19.150
HEY, WHY DON'T YOU TAKE A SEAT
嘿，你为什么不坐下来

08:19.250 --> 08:21.017
WHILE I GET TO WORK FOR YOU?
我什么时候为你工作？

08:21.118 --> 08:24.188
- WELL, DON'T MIND IF I DO.
- 好吧，别介意我这样做。

08:24.288 --> 08:27.023
- WOULD YOU LIKE ME
TO MAN THE GRILL FOR YOU TODAY?
- 你喜欢我吗
今天为您管理烧烤炉吗？

08:27.124 --> 08:28.992
- UH, EH...
- 呃，呃……

08:29.092 --> 08:30.694
- YOU DESERVE A BREAK.
- 你应该休息一下。

08:30.794 --> 08:33.630
AND I'VE BEEN ABLE TO HANDLE
EVERYTHING ELSE FOR YOU, SO...
我已经能够处理
其他一切都适合您，所以...

08:33.730 --> 08:34.831
- THAT IS TRUE.
- 确实如此。

08:34.931 --> 08:37.268
WELL, I GUESS I CAN TRUST YOU
WITH MY GRILL
好吧，我想我可以信任你
用我的烤架

08:37.368 --> 08:38.802
WHILE I TAKE A BRIEF RESPITE.
当我短暂休息时。

08:38.902 --> 08:41.872
- [bouncing]
[evil laugh]
- [弹跳]
[邪恶的笑声]

08:41.972 --> 08:45.609
YES! PHASE FIVE
IS FINALLY COMPLETE!
是的！第五阶段
终于完成了！

08:45.709 --> 08:49.112
TIME TO KICK PHASE SIX
INTO OVERDRIVE!
是时候开始第六阶段了
超速行驶！

08:51.515 --> 08:55.219
YES, BURN PATTIES, BURN!
是的，烧肉饼，烧！

08:55.319 --> 08:57.254
[evil laugh]
[邪恶的笑声]

08:57.354 --> 08:58.455
- [snores]
- [打鼾]

08:58.555 --> 09:00.524
[gagging, coughing]
[作呕，咳嗽]

09:00.624 --> 09:01.725
[screams]
[尖叫声]

09:01.825 --> 09:03.527
CHARRED KRABBY PATTY BITS?
烧焦的蟹肉饼块？

09:03.627 --> 09:05.095
SIZZLEMASTER, WHAT HAPPENED?
嘶嘶大师，发生了什么事？

09:05.196 --> 09:07.564
- OH, SPONGEBOB, I'M SORRY.
- 哦，海绵宝宝，对不起。

09:07.664 --> 09:09.966
I JUST WASN'T USED
TO THIS GRILL.
我只是没被利用过
到这个烧烤店。

09:10.066 --> 09:13.204
ALL OF THE KRABBY PATTIES
ARE GONE.
所有的蟹肉饼
走了。

09:13.304 --> 09:14.471
- OH, NO!
- 哦，不！

09:14.571 --> 09:15.972
- HEY, I GOT AN IDEA.
- 嘿，我有一个主意。

09:16.072 --> 09:18.609
I CAN MIX UP SOME NEW PATTIES
IN A JIFF.
我可以混合一些新馅饼
一瞬间。

09:18.709 --> 09:21.578
IF WE JUST GO GET
THE KRABBY PATTY SECRET FORMULA.
如果我们去得到
蟹肉饼的秘密配方。

09:21.678 --> 09:23.780
- OH, YEAH!
OKAY.
- 哦，是啊！
好的。

09:23.880 --> 09:25.516
IT'S JUST OVER HERE IN THE SAFE.
就在这儿的保险箱里。

09:25.616 --> 09:28.219
- YES! YES!
- 是的！是的！

09:28.252 --> 09:29.420
[evil laugh]
[邪恶的笑声]

09:29.520 --> 09:30.821
[lock ratcheting]
[棘轮锁]

09:30.921 --> 09:32.055
- [splashing]
- [溅水]

09:32.223 --> 09:33.757
HEY, WHATCHA DOING, BOY?
嘿，男孩在做什么？

09:33.857 --> 09:35.792
- OH, MY NEW MAGICAL
TALKING SPATULA
- 哦，我的新魔法
会说话的铲子

09:35.892 --> 09:37.027
THAT I GOT FROM PLANKTON
我从浮游生物那里得到的

09:37.127 --> 09:39.230
SAYS IT NEEDS YOUR
KRABBY PATTY SECRET FORMULA.
说它需要你的
蟹肉饼的秘密配方。

09:39.296 --> 09:41.232
- SPONGEBOB! NO!
- 海绵宝宝！不！

09:41.298 --> 09:45.836
UH, I MEAN, IT WAS
YOUR TALKING SPATULA, YOU SAY?
呃，我的意思是，它是
你说你的会说话的铲子？

09:45.936 --> 09:48.071
THAT YOU GOT FROM PLANKTON?
你从浮游生物那里得到的？

09:48.239 --> 09:51.242
[laughing] WELL,
WHY DIDN'T YOU SAY SO?
[笑] 嗯，
你为什么不这么说？

09:51.275 --> 09:56.947
HERE, GIVE YOUR TALKING SPATULA
THIS RECIPE.
在这里，拿出你的会说话的铲子
这个食谱。

09:57.047 --> 09:59.082
- MR. KRABS, I THINK
YOUR BLINKER'S BROKEN.
- 先生。螃蟹，我想
你的闪光灯坏了。

09:59.250 --> 10:00.116
- JUST READ IT.
- 请阅读它。

10:00.251 --> 10:01.117
- AYE, AYE.
- 是的，是的。

10:01.252 --> 10:02.386
OKAY, SIZZLEMASTER.
好的，嘶嘶声大师。

10:02.486 --> 10:04.655
THE FIRST INGREDIENT IS...
第一个成分是......

10:04.755 --> 10:07.157
"5 GALLONS
COMBUSTIBLE COOKING OIL."
“5 加仑
可燃食用油。”

10:07.258 --> 10:08.559
- YES!
- 是的！

10:08.659 --> 10:10.694
KAREN, BEGIN PRODUCTION!
凯伦，开始制作！

10:10.794 --> 10:11.695
[computer blipping]
[电脑嗡嗡响]

10:11.795 --> 10:13.163
[oil splatting]
[油溅]

10:13.264 --> 10:15.999
- "ONE SACK CORAL DUST,
EXTRA SPICY.
- “一袋珊瑚粉，
特辣。

10:16.099 --> 10:18.435
"ONE BUCKET FIRE ALGAE PASTE.
“一桶火藻膏。

10:18.535 --> 10:19.536
"AND THE FINAL INGREDIENT,
“最后的成分，

10:19.636 --> 10:20.837
DISULFIDE."
二硫化物。”

10:20.937 --> 10:22.739
- YES!
- 是的！

10:22.839 --> 10:23.807
[laughs]
[笑]

10:23.907 --> 10:26.377
WAIT, HOW MUCH DISULFIDE?
等等，有多少二硫化物？

10:26.477 --> 10:27.711
- [scribbles]
- [涂鸦]

10:27.811 --> 10:29.012
- "THE WHOLE ENCHILADA."
- “整个辣酱玉米饼馅。”

10:29.112 --> 10:31.315
- I HAD NO IDEA
THIS STUFF WAS APPROVED
- 我不知道
这东西被批准了

10:31.415 --> 10:32.549
FOR RESTAURANT USE.
供餐厅使用。

10:32.649 --> 10:34.418
- OH, IT'S NOT...
- 哦，这不是...

10:34.518 --> 10:36.152
PLANKTON.
浮游生物。

10:36.287 --> 10:38.355
- KRABS?
- 螃蟹？

10:41.091 --> 10:42.326
OH, NO.
哦，不。

10:47.431 --> 10:49.300
- QUITE A VOLATILE CONCOCTION,
- 相当不稳定的混合物，

10:49.400 --> 10:50.601
EH, PLANKY?
呃，普朗基？

10:50.701 --> 10:53.036
- MUST BE
EXPLOSIVE PATTY WEDNESDAY,
- 必须是
周三爆炸肉饼，

10:53.136 --> 10:54.305
EH, MR. KRABS?
呃，先生。螃蟹？

10:54.338 --> 10:55.939
- [chuckles]
- [轻笑]

10:56.039 --> 10:58.074
YOU GOT THAT RIGHT, BOYO.
你说得对，男孩。

10:58.174 --> 11:00.611
[chuckles]
- OH, HARDY-HAR-HAR.
[笑声]
- 哦，哈迪哈哈。

11:03.480 --> 11:06.383
[lilting ukulele music]
[轻快的尤克里里音乐]

11:06.483 --> 11:14.425
*
*
*
*

*